// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2952172834" "{PlayerSource} reduces your attack rate, movement speed, Defense, and Fire Damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P461379651" "Ice Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P157648600" "Ranged, Ally +DEF(Melee, Smash, Lethal), Res(Cold, Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1694311829" "Casts a rock hard Ice Shield on one of your allies and grants them Defense to Melee, Lethal attacks and damage resistance to Cold and Fire damage. You cannot stack multiple Ice Shields on the same target, however the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Glacial Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself.  Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1958975515" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Smashing and Lethal attacks and increase their Resistance to Fire and Cold Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3084486850" "You now have greater Defense to Smashing and Lethal attacks and have greater Damage Resistance to Cold and Fire damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3286670589" "+DEF(Melee, Smash, Lethal), Res(Cold, Fire)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Snow Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4107230931" "Snow Storm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P304532452" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Speed, -Recharge, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2037219656" "While active, the chill from this Snow Storm can dramatically Slow the attack and movement speed of the target and all nearby foes. The torrent winds of the Snow Storm are enough to bring down flying foes. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3344262446" "You slow the attack and movement speed of all foes near {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3098549163" "Your attack speed and movement rate have been slowed by {PlayerSource}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P146324422" "-Speed, -Recharge, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1154831319" "Your attack rate and running speed have been reduced by the Snow Storm. The Torrent winds are hindering your ability to Fly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Glacial Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2645153605" "Glacial Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3678729413" "Ranged, Ally +DEF(Ranged, AoE, Energy, Negative), Res(Cold)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3134501945" "Envelopes an ally in gleaming Glacial Ice. Its crystalline structure has refracting properties that grants the target good Defense against Area Effect, Ranged, Energy and Negative Energy attacks.  Glacial Shield also grants the target some damage resistance to Cold. You cannot stack multiple Glacial Shields on the same target, however the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Ice Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1548563359" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Energy and Negative Energy attacks and increase their Resistance to Cold Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P147881231" "You now have greater Defense to Energy and Negative Energy attacks and have greater Damage Resistance to Cold damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1286641280" "+DEF(Energy, Negative), Res(Cold)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frostwork 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P736381502" "Frostwork"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2319784263" "Target +Max HP, Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P274192473" "Covers an ally in a thick layer of Frost. The frost can absorb the impact from enemy attacks, effectively increasing your ally's maximum Hit Points for a short time. Frostwork also grants your ally resistance to Toxic Damage. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3067795486" "Your {PowerName} increases the maximum Hit Points or {PlayerDest} and grants them some resistance to Toxic damage."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3244650070" "{PlayerSource} has increases your maximum Hit Points with {PowerName} and grants you some resistance to Toxic damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P862573566" "+Max HP, Res(Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1386939" "Your maximum health is increased and you have some resistance to toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Arctic Fog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P505098763" "Arctic Fog"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2062819311" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team Stealth, +DEF,  +Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Slow)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2306566026" "Your mastery of Cold allows you to hide yourself and all nearby allies within thick Arctic Fog. Arctic Fog makes you and your allies harder to see and increases your Defense to area effect, melee and ranged attacks, as well as your resistance to Slow, Fire, Cold, and Energy damage. You cannot use any other Concealment type powers while using Arctic Fog.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1701765549" "You hide {PlayerDest} within your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3391829817" "You are hidden within the {PowerName}."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :
"P3802943013" "Avoided"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3234644764" "Stealth, +DEF,  +Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Slow)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4211426561" "The Arctic Fog is making you more difficult to detect.  This increases your Defense and gives you some resistance to Fire, Cold, Energy and Slow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Benumb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1487719916" "Benumb"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2863146898" "Ranged Foe -DMG, -END, -Regeneration, -Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1665529547" "Numbs a single target to its very core.  Benumb reduces the target's core body temperature, dramatically weakening them.  A Benumbed target's Damage and Regeneration Rate are greatly reduced.  Additionally, the affected target's secondary power effects are all weakened. The target's powers' effects like Heals, Defense Buffs, Endurance Drains, Disorients, Holds, Immobilizes, Knockbacks and more, are all weakened.  Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3420705000" "Your {PowerName} reduced the Damage output, HP Regeneration and power effects of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1696097231" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Damage output, HP Regeneration and power effects."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P888300159" "-DMG, -Regeneration, -Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P838811387" "Your Damage output, HP Regeneration and power effects have all been reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2154700027" "Your {PowerName} drains some endurance from {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P456748222" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with their {PowerName} and drains some of your Endurance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sleet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3382651313" "Sleet"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1355298513" "Ranged (Location AoE), Minor DoT(Cold), Foe -Speed, -Recharge, -DEF -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P3712729563" "Summons a Sleet Storm at a targeted location. Sleet deals minimal Cold damage to anything that passes through the storm. It also Slows the affected foes and severely reduces their Defense and resistance to damage. Many foes may even slip and fall trying to escape the storm. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3124605688" "DoT(Cold), -DMG, -Res, -SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2628796128" "The Fog is causing cold damage to you and has reduced your damage potential, resistance, attack rate and running speed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3955584513" "You call forth {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heat Loss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P950820295" "Heat Loss"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P754231800" "Ranged (Foe AoE), Foe -RES, -END, Slow; Team +END, +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2236440889" "Heat Loss drains the heat from your enemies and transfers that energy to your allies in the form of Endurance. All foes near the selected target may experience a Heat Loss, which will drain their Endurance, Slow them, and reduce their Damage Resistance.  Each enemy target that is successfully drained of Heat will expel that energy to all your nearby allies, granting them Endurance and a boost to their Endurance Recovery. Some Endurance and Recovery will also be transferred directly to you and any allies near you. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4067098136" "You drain the heat from {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1713096329" "{PlayerSource} drains the heat from you with their {PowerName}!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Darkness Affinity 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P414675575" "Darkness Affinity"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2881268957" "Focus the dark power of the Netherworld to weaken your foes and aid your allies. Darkness Affinity focuses on draining your opponent."
// SetAccountTooltip :
"P1175463420" "You need to either be a VIP player or have purchased the Darkness Affinity power set to have access to this feature."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Twilight Grasp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4164717180" "Twilight Grasp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1331656250" "Ranged, Foe -To Hit, -DMG, -Regen, Team Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P3867344021" "You channel Negative Energy from the Netherworld through yourself to a targeted foe. Twilight Grasp drains the power from that target and slowly transfers it to you and all nearby allies. The targeted foe's chance to hit, damage and regeneration rate are reduced, while you and your nearby allies are healed. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
