// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P181463503" "You have been Disoriented.  Your Attack rate and Running speed are reduced by the Howling Twilight."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P713892034" "You disorient {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3202947871" "{PlayerSource} disorients you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadow Fall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2272064692" "Shadow Fall"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4241292887" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Energy, Negative, Psionics, Fear)"
// Power Help Text :
"P890111217" "Envelops you and your nearby teammates in a shroud of darkness. Shadow Fall does not grant Invisibility, but it does make you harder to detect. Even if you are discovered, Shadow Fall grants a bonus to Defense bonus to all attacks and Resistance to Fear, while reducing Energy, Negative Energy, and Psionic Damage. You cannot use any other Concealment type power while using Shadow Fall. Recharge: Slow"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1493333783" "You are hidden within the Shadow Fall."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2430370769" "Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Energy, Negative, Psionics, Fear))"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2614214872" "Shadow Fall has made you difficult to detect, which increases your Defense.  Shadowfall also partially absorbs and deflects Energy, Negative Energy and Psionic damage. You are also less fearful."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3932635806" "Fade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1028570823" "PBAoE Ally, +Defense(All), +Res(Defense Debuffs, Lethal, Smash, Negative, Psionic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1178618076" "You partially bring yourself and all nearby allies into the Netherworld vastly increasing their Defense to all attacks and resistance to lethal, smashing, negative energy and psionic damage for a very short period of time as well as dramatically increasing their resistance to Defense Debuffs. This power is best used to help counter a dangerous situation. Recharge: Very Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1756086205" "+Def(All), +Res(Defense Debuffs, Lethal, Smash, Negative, Psionic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P48201341" "Your defense and lethal, smashing, psionic and negative energy resistance has been dramatically increased for a short time by Fade."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
