// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2347821665" "PBAoE Team +Regen, +Recovery, Foe -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P1661664098" "You drain the essence of both nearby conscious and defeated foes to cause you and your allies to regenerate and recovery much more quickly. The more defeated foes affected, the more powerful the regeneration and recovery effect will be. Recharge: Very Slow."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4006859605" "Your {PowerName} siphons essence from nearby foes to cause you and your team to regenerate health and recover endurance."
