"P771199714" "Summons a Dark Servant to your aid. The Dark Servant possesses an assortment of dark powers to weaken your foes. The summoned entity is not a willing servant, and it is only your power that binds it in this realm.  The Dark Servant can be buffed and healed. Recharge: Very Long"

