// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Personal Force Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3978803010" "Personal Force Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3032934705" "Toggle: Self +Def, Res(All except Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1475204497" "The Personal Force Field is almost impenetrable to all attacks, even Psionics and Enemy Teleportation, although attacks from more powerful foes may get through more easily. Personal Force Field will also reduce the damage of almost any attacks that do get through.  The Personal Force Field works both ways; while it is active, you can only use powers that affect yourself. Cannot be used with Rest. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3782792257" "Your {PowerName} makes you virtually invulnerable to most attacks, but you can only cast powers on yourself while the Force Field is active."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Deflection Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1823934049" "Deflection Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1152404173" "Ranged, Ally +DEF(Smash, Lethal, Melee), Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1966278961" "Dramatically protects an ally from Smashing, Lethal and all Melee attacks for a limited time.  Also reduces Toxic damage. You cannot stack multiple Deflection Shields on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Insulation Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P737094794" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Smashing, Lethal and Melee attacks, as well as Toxic Damage, with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2660225500" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Smashing, Lethal and Melee attacks with a {PowerName} and grants you some resistance to Toxic damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2240545096" "+DEF(Smash, Lethal, Melee), Res(Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P639359596" "You have been encased in a Deflection Shield.  Your Defense to Smashing, Lethal and Melee attacks is increased, and your ability to resist Toxic attacks is increased as well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3532762553" "Force Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1949322042" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1133545432" "Discharges a bolt of force that knocks down foes and deals some Smashing Damage. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1956747474" "Your {PowerName} pounds {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P524369720" "{PlayerSource} pounds you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4243055354" "You knocked {PlayerDest} from their feet with your {PowerName} attack!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2549913424" "{PlayerSource} knocks you from your feet with their {PowerName} attack!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1494496101" "Your {PowerName} temporarily disables a power in use by {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4104148329" "{PlayerSource}  temporarily disables one of your powers in use with their {PowerName} attack!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Insulation Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4034787409" "Insulation Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3550036896" "Ranged, Ally +DEF(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative, Ranged, AoE), Res (End Drain)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1302168924" "Dramatically protects an ally from Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy, Ranged and AoE attacks for a limited time. The Insulation also protects the target from Endurance Draining effects. You cannot stack multiple Insulation Shields on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Deflection Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1217548023" "You protect {PlayerDest} from fire, cold, energy, negative energy, ranged and AoE attacks with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2372394357" "{PlayerSource} protects you from fire, cold, energy, negative energy, ranged and AoE attacks with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P346136420" "+DEF(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative, Ranged, AoE)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3977068540" "The Insulation Shield is improving your Defense to Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy, Ranged and AoE attacks. The Insulation Shield also protects you from Endurance Draining effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Refraction Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3517858636" "Detention Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3258422862" "Ranged, Foe Capture (Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1774286945" "Encases a targeted foe in a Detention Force Field. The captured target cannot be harmed, is Immobilized, and cannot attack or aid their allies. The target can, however, use powers on themselves. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1145282425" "Capture"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3938244390" "You have been captured in a Detention Field.  You cannot be harmed, however, you can only use powers which affect yourself."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2641364819" "You encase {PlayerDest} in an impenetrable {PowerName}.  They cannot move and can only affect themselves now."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1053776284" "{PlayerSource} encases you in an impenetrable {PowerName}. You cannot move and can only affect yourself!"

