"P3990140054" "Repulsion Bomb"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2541127357" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Knockdown, Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P2080279324" "A powerful Repulsion Bomb is hurled at your foes dealing a moderate amount of damage and knocking them off of their feet. Foes struck by Repulsion Bomb have a good chance to become disoriented.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
