"P4195196004" "Force Bubble"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2016297432" "Toggle: PBAoE Foe Repel, Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P294228437" "Creates a large bubble which protects all allies inside. While active, this power keeps all foes at bay, protecting all allies inside from melee or short ranged attacks. More powerful foes may be able to penetrate the Force Bubble, but may slip and get knocked down and forced back if they try. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P947844219" "Your {PowerName} keeps your foes at bay."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1153017445" "You knocked {PlayerDest} from their feet with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4162104512" "{PlayerSource} knocks you from your feet with their {PowerName}!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P446784796" "Your {PowerName} partially hit!  {PlayerDest} is not repelled by the Force Bubble!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P500455014" "{Playersource} partially hits you with their Force Bubble! You evaded the Repel!"

