"P1213219189" "Kinetics"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1630872074" "You are a master at manipulating and transferring Kinetic energy. You can manipulate the potential energy found in objects to aid your allies or weaken your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
