"P3972645459" "Ranged, Foe -Speed, -Recharge, Self +Speed, +Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P2146416737" "You can Siphon the speed from a targeted foe, Slowing their movement and attack rate while boosting your own. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1490875287" "-SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3187278069" "Your Running Speed potential has been altered.  If this is a friendly power, your Running Speed is increased.  If you were attacked with this power, though, your Running Speed is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3760447537" "You {PowerName} from {PlayerDest} to increase your own!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1887331290" "{PlayerSource} slows you with {PowerName} to increase their own!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Increase Density 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3687435012" "Increase Density"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1601178268" "Ranged, Ally Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P642054627" "Increases an ally's mass, freeing them from any Disorient, Immobilization, or Hold effects and leaving them resistant to such effects for a while. Increase Density also protects the target from Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleportation, as well as Smashing and Energy damage. Because the target grows more dense, their movement speed is Slowed. Although the Damage Resistance and slowing effect will not stack with multiple applications, the rest of the effects of Increase Density will. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1924523378" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Holds, Immobilization, Disorient, Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleportation, as well as smashing and energy damage with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3719467599" "{PlayerSource} protect you from Holds, Immobilization, Disorient, Knockback, Repel, and enemy Teleportation, as well as smashing and energy damage"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1228522254" ""+Res(Special)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1912899325" "Your Resistance to Smashing and Energy attacks has been increased.  You are more resistant to Hold, Disorient, Immobilize, Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleport attacks, but your movement rates are slightly reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Speed Boost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3686758356" "Speed Boost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P146937202" "Ranged, Ally +SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, Res Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P553862191" "You can hasten a single targeted ally. The target's movement speed, attack rate, and Endurance recovery are all greatly increased and the target gains resistance to Slow effects. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1930511113" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest}, greatly increasing their movement rate, attack rate and endurance recovery!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2717324833" "{PlayerSource} improves your movement rate, attack rate and endurance recovery with an extra {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P922167688" "+SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, Res Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1810162801" "You've been granted a Speed Boost.  Your Attack speed, Endurance recovery and Running speed are all increased and you are resistant to Slow effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Inertial Reduction 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4081596977" "Inertial Reduction"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3810722637" "PBAoE, Allies +Jump"
// Power Help Text :
"P1170626945" "You can reduce your Inertia, along with that of all nearby allies. The affected heroes can then jump incredible distances for a while. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2870689215" "Your {PowerName} allows you to jump incredible distances!"
