// Power Help Text :
"P1823443521" "You encase yourself and nearby allies in a protective barrier that will absorb a moderate amount of damage.  Additionally, affected allies will heal for a portion of their health over time.  Wild Bastion places 3 stacks of Bloom on all affected targets.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
