"P2841584505" "You are a master of Poison and can concoct a variety of venoms and toxins allowing you to weaken your enemies.  When used correctly, some Poisons can even be used to aid your allies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Alkaloid 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3338218470" "Alkaloid"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P192217088" "Ally Heal, +Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P633752156" "When used correctly, poisons can be used to heal, as well as harm.  Alkaloid consists of just the right amount of amino acids to safely heal a single targeted ally. The healed target is also left with some resistance to Toxic Damage (This Toxic Damage Resistance cannot be Enhanced). You cannot use this power to heal yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1198011080" "You heal {PlayerDest} {Damage} points of damage and improve their resistance to Toxic Damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P711986937" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} points of damage and improves you resistance to Toxic Damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Envenom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1357149555" "Envenom"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2033004693" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -RES, -DEF, -Regen, -Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P4054932572" "You Envenom your foe with a nasty poison, the poison then spreads to nearby foes.  The toxin directly attacks the immune system, reducing the affected target's Defense, Damage Resistance and Hit Point Regeneration Rate.  The poison is so potent, that the target actually responds less to Healing while affected by the poison.   Secondary foes struck by this power will have a lesser effect placed on them while the primary target receives the full effectiveness of the power.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2132842561" "You Envenom {PlayerDest} and reduced their Defense and Damage Resistance and Regeneration."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4263359596" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Defense, Damage Resistance and Regeneration with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1511201118" "-RES, -DEF, -Regen, -Heal"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3705153969" "Your Defense, Damage Resistances and Regeneration have been reduced.  You also Heal less from Heal powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Weaken 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2214790859" "Weaken"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3098322516" "Ranged (Targeted AoE) Foe -DMG -To Hit, -Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P4153236241" "You poison a single foe with a venom that significantly Weakens their strength and and that of nearby foes.   The affected primary target's chance to hit and Damage output is severely reduced Additionally, the affected targets secondary power effects are all weakened. The targets power effects like Heals, Defense Buffs, Endurance Drains, Disorients, Holds, Immobilizes, Knockbacks and more, are all weakened.  Secondary foes struck by this power will have a lesser effect placed on them while the primary target receives the full effectiveness of the power.  Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4213374470" "You Weaken {PlayerDest} and reduce their chance to hit, damage and power effects."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1094182561" "{PlayerSource} reduces your chance to hit, Damage and power effects with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1749202183" "-To Hit, -DMG, -Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P870938078" "Your chance to hit and Damage potential and power effects have all been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Neurotoxic Breath 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1837006782" "Neurotoxic Breath"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3242282090" "Ranged (Cone), Foe -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P413475405" "You can breath a cone of Neurotoxin gas that quickly start to anesthetize any nearby foes.  Affected targets may choke on the gas as their movement and attack rate are severely reduced. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P706922686" "Your {PowerName} dramatically Slows the attack speed and movement of {PlayerDest}"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3646837205" "{PlayerSource} Slows you with their {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3697806060" "You are choking on Neurotoxic gas.  Your attack rate and movement speed are reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Elixir of Life 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2164945405" "Elixir of Life"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2944072660" "Close, Ally Rez, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2036775056" "With this Elixir, you can revive a fallen ally and turn him into a killing machine. The revived target has increased damage, chance to hit, Endurance recovery, and attack speed, and gains a resistance to Toxic damage. A brew of this sort is not without its side effects. The revived target will soon become very sick and severely weak after about 90 seconds. All effects of the Elixir will eventually wear off. Elixir of Life can only be used on Players and cannot be used on your Henchmen.  Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayConfirm :
"P2987816183" "{PlayerSource} would like to Resurrect you.  You will have full Health and Endurance and be extremely powerful for a while, but will weaken after 90 seconds. Do you Accept?"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2211841663" "Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4150946459" "Your have been saved by the Elixir of Life.  Your chance to hit and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well and you gain a resistance to Toxic damage.  You are also protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. The experience is taxing however, and you will soon weaken when all of the effects of the Elixir wear off."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2180373901" "You give {PlayerDest} your Elixir of Life and revive them returning {Damage} points of health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1078120874" "{PlayerSource} returns you from the brink of death and heals you for {Damage} points of damage with an Elixir of Life. For a while, the Elixir has increased strength, but it will wears off fast, and you will be become sick and weak in about 90 seconds."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3379169905" "Your Elixir has worn off, and you are now sick and weakened."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Antidote 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3729372453" "Antidote"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1579801539" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Slow, Cold, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1204937636" "This Antidote can free an ally from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Slow, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects and leaves them resistant to such effects for a good while. The Antidote also grants the target some resistance to Cold and Toxic damage. Some of the effects of this power will improve with Multiple applications and as you advance in level. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4104594625" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects as well as Toxic and Cold Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1108383803" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects and improves your resistance to Toxic and Cold Damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P456139789" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Slow, Cold, Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P69254025" "The Antidote has granted you temporary resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse and Fear and Immobilize effects and your resistance to Toxic and Cold Damage is improved."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Paralytic Poison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2127894003" "Paralytic Poison"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P778647036" "Ranged Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P4045211070" "This Paralytic Poison viciously attacks a foe's nervous system and can leave an affected target completely Held and defenseless. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2901818041" "Your {Powername} Holds {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3786662314" "{PlayerSource} attempts to Hold you with a Paralytic Poison."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3220742713" "Hold"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3285550051" "The Paralytic Poison has left you completely Held and defenseless!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poison Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1358094474" "Poison Trap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P673564903" "Place Trap: PBAoE Foe Hold, -END, -Recovery, Chance to Hold, Minor DoT(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1057178172" "You can build a Poison Trap on the ground. Any foes that pass near the Poison Trap will cause it to detonate and release its toxic vapors. The poison is a highly toxic nerve gas, and any foes in the affected area may be drained of much of their Endurance and quickly Held or begin choking while suffering a minor amount of Toxic damage over time.  The trap is almost impossible to detect, but it is fragile and may be set off by an enemy's explosion. Even if destroyed, the Trap will detonate. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Venomous Gas 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1986312287" "Venomous Gas"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1112704536" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe -Res(All), -DMG(All), -Def(All), -To(Hit)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1183280710" "You surround yourself in a cloud of toxic vapors that significantly weaken any enemies that get near you.  Affected foes have their defense, damage resistance, damage and chance to hit reduced moderately.  Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1577325525" "Your {PowerName} weakens all nearby enemies!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3466742994" "-Res(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3288548701" "-Res(All), -DMG(All), -Def(All), -To Hit"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Radiation Emission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3883900150" "Radiation Emission"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2059255153" "Radiation Emission powers allow you to manipulate atomic particles and waves to protect your allies and weaken your enemies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Radiation Emission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3533172966" "Radiant Aura"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P336745852" "PBAoE, Ally +Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P972381749" "You can use Radiant Aura to heal some of your wounds, and the wounds of your group. This power has a small radius, so your allies need to be near you if they wish to be affected. Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Radiation Infection 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3091774412" "Radiation Infection"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1946311240" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DEF, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P3488173255" "Infects a targeted foe with deadly radiation, severely reducing their chance to hit and Defense. All foes that come near the target will also become infected. The Radiation Infection will last until you deactivate it, or until the original target is defeated. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2574572377" "Your {PowerName} weakens all nearby foes."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3177972463" "You have been weakened by a {PowerName} from {PlayerSource}, decreasing your chance to hit and defense!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2125517953" "-DEF, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4112896100" "The Radiation Infection has reduced your Defense and chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Accelerate Metabolism 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P275167913" "Accelerate Metabolism"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2302020220" "Close (AoE), Ally +SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, +DMG +Res(Effects)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1318712485" "Activating this power emits radiation that increases the running speed, attack speed, Endurance recovery, and damage potential of all nearby allies. Affected heroes' metabolisms are increased so much that they become resistant to effects such as Sleep, Hold, Disorient, Immobilization and Endurance Drain. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1550301107" "You begin to accelerate your metabolism, and the metabolism of all nearby allies."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3547230991" "{PlayerSource} boosts your damage, speed, recharge, recovery and resistance to status effects with {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2942153168" "+SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, +Dam, +Res(Effects)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2897583752" "Your metabolism has been boosted.  Your movement speed and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well.  Lastly, you are resistant to Sleep, Mez, Disorient, Immobilization and Endurance Drain."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Enervating  Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1082274496" "Enervating Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2214322243" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DMG, -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P3687495261" "While this power is active, you irradiate a targeted foe, and all foes nearby, with a deadly dose of radiation. This radiation weakens exposed targets, decreasing the damage of their attacks.  It also significantly weakens their resistance, so they will take much more damage from other attacks. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2100668018" "Your {PowerName} reduced the damage potential of all nearby foes."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1913293537" "{PlayerSource} reduced your damage and resistance to damage with an {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3022714566" "-DMG, -Res"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3774123069" "Your Damage potential and Resistances have been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3057588896" "Mutation"
// Power Help Text :
"P1826458748" "Using a concentrated burst of radiation, you can revive a fallen hero and Mutate them into a killing machine. The Mutated hero has increased damage, chance to hit, Endurance recovery, and attack speed and is protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. The entire experience is very taxing on the Mutated hero, and they will soon be severely weakened. All effects of the Mutation will eventually wear off. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayConfirm :
"P285856014" "{PlayerSource} would like to Resurrect and Mutate you.  You will have full Health and Endurance and be extremely powerful for a while, but will weaken after 90 seconds. Do you Accept?"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1832549363" "Mutated"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3576880470" "Your have been mutated.  Your chance to hit and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well.  You are also protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. The experience is taxing however, and you will soon weaken when all of the effects of this mutation wear off."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P920298392" "You Mutate {PlayerDest} and heal them for {Damage} points of damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3161843313" "Your accelerated Mutation has worn off, and you are now weakened."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lingering radiation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3321233827" "Lingering Radiation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4020505167" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Speed, -Recharge, -Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P1417733947" "You can emit Lingering Radiation that reduces the attack rate, movement speed, and Regeneration rate of the target, and all nearby foes. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3060559231" "Your {PowerName} Slows all nearby foes."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2645330428" "{PlayerSource} slows your attack speed, movement rate and regeneration rate with their {PowerName}"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P319543156" "-SPD, -Recharge, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3611700118" "Your Attack rate, Running speed, and Regeneration rate have been reduced by the Lingering Radiation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Choking Cloud 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2196045966" "Choking Cloud"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1228973208" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2718652843" "While active, you generate toxic radioactive gas around yourself. Any nearby foes may be overcome by the gas, leaving them choking and helpless. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P835496752" "You are caught in a Choking Cloud."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fallout 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P310781374" "Fallout"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P783614258" "Post-Defeat: PBAoE, Extreme DMG(Energy), Foe -To Hit, -DEF, -DMG, -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2435590890" "After an ally falls in battle, you can activate this power to extract the energy from their body to deal a massive amount of Energy damage to any nearby foes. All affected foes are extremely weakened by the Fallout, and their chance to hit, Defense, Damage and Damage Resistance is severely reduced.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2158078059" "You use the energy of {PlayerDest} to unleash a massive {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2416771117" "{PlayerSource} uses your energy to unleash a massive {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EMP Pulse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P987369644" "EM Pulse"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3111590990" "PBAoE, Foe Hold, -END, -Regen, Special vs. Robots; Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P3436877588" "You can unleash a massive pulse of electromagnetic energy. This EMP can affect machines, and is even powerful enough to affect synaptic brain patterns.  It will drain the Endurance and HP Regeneration of all affected targets and leave them incapacitated and Held for a long while. Additionally, most machines and robots will take moderate high damage. However, this power uses a lot of Endurance and leaves you unable to recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P799513638" "Hold, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3632529316" "You are Held by the EMP Pulse and your Regeneration Rate is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1102804825" "Your {PowerName} drains {PlayerDest} of some Endurance."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3216666060" "Your {PowerName} reduces the regeneration rate of {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1491019888" "{PlayerSource} reduces your regeneration rate with an {PowerName}"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1746676435" "Your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2665432657" "Your {PowerName} has left you exhausted!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Sonic Debuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P565143336" "Sonic Resonance"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2998248482" "You have the ability to control sound in several fashions.  You can create semi-solid barriers, set up waves which weaken or strengthen a target, as well as creating soothing sounds which act to counteract any negative effects which may exist on your friends."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Siphon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P646438851" "Sonic Siphon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3255195607" "Ranged, Foe -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1007995414" "By setting up a constant vibration within the body of your foe, you weaken their Damage Resistance. Affected targets will take more damage from successful attacks.   Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3647738614" "Your {PowerName} has reduced {PlayerDest}'s resistances."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P182951110" "Your resistance to damage has been reduced by the {PowerName} of {PlayerSource}."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P290923559" "Your Resistances have been weakened by the Sonic attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Barrier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3785736125" "Sonic Barrier"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2639635747" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Smash, Lethal, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2545197852" "This shield dramatically reduces the damage an ally takes from Smashing, Lethal, and Toxic attacks for a limited time. You cannot stack multiple Sonic Barriers on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Sonic Haven. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2959881722" "You protect {PlayerDest} from physical attacks with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3976820757" "{PlayerSource} protects you from physical attacks with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3556417710" "+Res(Smash, Lethal, Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1911675282" "The Sonic Shield has increased your resistances to Smashing, Lethal and Toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Haven 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1160094573" "Sonic Haven"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3358878122" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2453669508" "This shield dramatically reduces the damage an ally takes from Fire, Cold, Energy, and Negative Energy attacks for a limited time. You cannot stack multiple Sonic Havens on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Sonic Barrier. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P321411657" "+Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P247047123" "The Sonic Shield has increased your resistances to Fire, Cold, Energy and Negative Energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Cage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1900924020" "Sonic Cage"
// Power Help Text :
"P498296898" "Encases the target in an impenetrable field of sonic waves. The target cannot attack or be attacked. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3173278283" "You have been encased in a Sonic Cage.  You cannot be harmed, but you can only use powers which affect you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disruption Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2857326375" "Disruption Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2877695354" "Toggle: Ranged (Target Ally AoE), Foe -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P2163685874" "You set up a constant wave of sonic energy around an ally, weakening the Damage Resistance of all nearby foes. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1058328827" "The Ally Buff Field creates an area around a target ally which reduces the Resistance of all foes near them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Dispersion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P134395228" "Sonic Dispersion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2105574571" "Toggle: PBAoE, Ally +Res(All DMG except Psionic, Hold, Immobilize, Disorient)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3945274325" "You create a large field of sonic waves, protecting all allies inside. The Sonic Dispersion gives all allies within increased Resistance against all damage except Psionic. The Sonic Bubble also protects allies from Immobilization, Disorient, and Hold effects. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3939492490" "You protect {PlayerDest} from most damage types with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2535806516" "{PlayerSource} protects you from most damage types with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2481919485" "+Res(All Damage but Psionic, Hold, Immobilize, Disorient)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1969680326" "The Sonic Bubble is granting you Resistance to all types of damage as well as Hold, Immobilize and Disorienting effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic  Repulsion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P448289933" "Sonic  Repulsion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2989681105" "Toggle: Ranged (Target Ally AoE), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1783834580" "You create a powerful sonic resonance around an ally, repelling all foes nearby. You will lose endurance for each target repelled.  Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P146549774" "You protect {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}, and will knock down any villain that approach them."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2574818106" "{PlayerSource} protects you with a {PowerName}, knocking back any foes that get too close."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P310186307" "A sonic field has been placed around you, which repels all foes who attempt to get near you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Clarity 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3612462228" "Clarity"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2123823464" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Terrorize, Confusion), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P3551660960" "By bouncing a carefully pitched sound wave off an ally's ear drum, you can free them from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear, or Immobilize effects, and leave them resistant to such effects for a good while. Protection will improve with multiple applications and as you advance in level. Clarity also provides your ally enhanced perception. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3167097237" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear, and Immobilize effects with your {PowerName} power, and improve their Perception."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3784635774" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear, and Immobilize effects and improve your Perception."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P614519586" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse, Immobilize), +Perception"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1217409435" "The soothing waves of sound clear your mind of all Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear, and Immobilize effects and improve your Perception."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Liquefy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4245490498" "Liquefy"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2188979389" "Ranged (Location AoE), Minor DMG(Smashing/Energy), Foe Hold, Knockdown, -To Hit, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1228883369" "You unleash a barrage of sonic waves on the Earth itself, generating a powerful, localized earthquake. The impact of the sonic shockwave may Hold some foes and deal some minor damage. Most foes that pass through the location will fall down. The violent shaking also reduces their chance to hit and Defense. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4153304885" "Hold, -To Hit, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1314129090" "The ground beneath you has been liquefied!  You are stuck in sludge and taking minor damage.  Your chance to hit, Defense and movement rates are reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P258400189" "You {PowerName} the ground!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
