// Power : O2 Boost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4232593684" "O2 Boost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1565891011" "Ally Heal, +Res(Disorient, Sleep, End Drain), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P3114444064" "Saturates the air around a targeted ally with rich oxygen, healing their wounds. The O2 Boost can protect a targeted ally from Sleep, Stun and Endurance Drain effects as well as increase perception. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1630761439" "Res(Disorient, Sleep, End Drain)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1243226818" "The O2 Boost has improved your resistance to Sleep, Stun and Endurance Drain effects."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2736283525" "{PlayerDest} is healed for {Damage} points of damage and is protected from Sleep and Disorientation."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3172217792" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} points of damage and protect you from Sleep and Disorientation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Snow Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P94096402" "You Slow the attack and movement speed of all nearby foes with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4081415245" "{PlayerSource} slows you with a {PowerName}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Steamy Mist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P88341138" "Steamy Mist"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P647071371" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Confuse)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2439766910" "Your mastery of the elements allows you to hide yourself and all nearby allies within a Steamy Mist. Steamy Mist makes you and your allies harder to see and increases your Defense bonus to all attacks, while reducing Fire, Cold, and Energy damage, as well as your Foes ability to Confuse you. You cannot use any other Concealment type powers while using Steamy Mist.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1096343037" "{PlayerSource} hides you within their {PowerName}"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4117047074" "Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Confuse)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1369785806" "The Steamy Mist is making you more difficult to detect.  This increases your Defense and gives you some resistance to Fire, Cold, Energy and Confuse."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1603587547" "Freezing Rain"
// Power Help Text :
"P1442985771" "Summons Freezing Rain at a targeted location. Freezing Rain deals minimal Cold damage to anything that passes through the storm. It also Slows the affected foes and severely reduces their Defense and resistance to damage. Many foes may even slip and fall trying to escape the storm. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3768531935" "The Freezing Rain is causing cold damage to you and has reduced your damage potential, resistance, attack rate and running speed."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1985334123" "You call forth a {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hurricane 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1760327861" "Hurricane"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1862200715" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe -Range, -To Hit, Repel, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3414490863" "You can summon a Hurricane. The wind and rain from this massive storm reduce the range and chance to hit of nearby foes. The massive winds of this storm continuously force foes away from you. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P550045858" "You reduce the range and chance to hit of all nearby foes with your {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3138537290" "-Range, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3051269457" "Hurricane Force winds are reducing the visual range and chance to hit of all enemies around the Storm Summoner!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2587177338" "Your {PowerName} partially hit!  {PlayerDest} is not repelled by the Hurricane!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3821930393" "{Playersource} partially hits you with their Hurricane! You evaded the Repel!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thunder Clap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3304416267" "Thunder Clap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P824375189" "PBAoE, Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P159762564" "You can call forth a tremendous Thunder Clap that will Disorient most foes in a large area around you. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2901563750" "The Thunder Clap has left you Disoriented."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tornado 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2117529527" "Tornado"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3544628265" "Summon Tornado: PBAoE Minor DMG(Smash), Foe Knockback, Fear, Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P254400622" "Conjures up a funnel cloud at a targeted location. The Tornado will chase down your foes, tossing them into the air and hurling them great distances. The victims are left Disoriented and with reduced Defense. The Tornado is a menacing sight, and can even cause panic among your foes. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2919214753" "You have been Disoriented by the Tornado."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P741247010" "Lightning Storm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3390340215" "Create Storm: Ranged, High DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1054232470" "You can create a massive Lightning Storm that will strike any foe that approaches you. Lightning from this storm can knock down and damage all nearby foes, and can even instill panic. Lightning bolts will continue to fall as long as the storm remains. Recharge: Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Thermal Radiation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1881175236" "Thermal Radiation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2307345259" "You have the ability to control heat and Thermal Radiation.  This allows you to protect allies from harm, heal them or increase their abilities.  You can also weaken your enemies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Warmth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2367202029" "Warmth"
// Power Help Text :
"P2993381279" "You can use your Warmth to heal some of your wounds, and the wounds of your group. This power has a small radius, so your allies need to be near you if they wish to be affected. Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P576070762" "Thermal Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1684799313" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Fire, Lethal, Smash, Cold)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2409765686" "Casts a Thermal Shield on one of your allies and grants them damage resistance to Lethal, Smashing and Fire damage. Thermal Shield also provides minimal resistance to Cold damage. You cannot stack multiple Thermal Shields on the same target, however the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Plasma Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself.  Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2577444705" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Smashing, Lethal, Fire and Cold Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2842680320" "You are now more resistant to Smashing, Lethal, Fire, and Cold damage, due to the {PowerName} from {PlayerSource}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Cauterize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P207511356" "Cauterize"
// Power Help Text :
"P3874865543" "Heals a single targeted ally by cauterizing their wounds. You cannot use this power to heal yourself. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Plasma Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1907338798" "Plasma Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3994307906" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Energy, Negative, Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P530377386" "Envelope an ally in pure plasma. The Plasma Shield gives your ally resistance to Energy, Negative Energy, and Fire damage. You cannot stack multiple Plasma Shields on the same target, however the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Fire Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P507595321" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Energy, Negative Energy and Fire Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1541038042" "You are now more resistant to Energy, Negative Energy, and Fire damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power of the Phoenix 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4203838221" "Power of the Phoenix"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3997289450" "Ally Rez, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P280766623" "Revives a fallen ally. The fiery resurrection blasts nearby foes with an explosion and knocks them down and Disorients them. Your ally will revive with most of their Hit Points and Endurance.  They will also be invulnerable for a brief time, as well as protected from XPDebt for 90 seconds.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3686639660" "You rise {PlayerDest} from the ashes with the power of the Phoenix."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1384260762" "You rise from the ashes with the Power of the Phoenix."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2862738113" "Invulnerable, +XP Debt Protection"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1011213513" "You have risen from the ashes. You are untouchable for 15 seconds and are protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P297828065" "Your {PowerName} brings {PlayerDest} back from the brink of defeat!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2874174058" "The {PowerName} of {PlayerSource} brings you back from the brink of defeat!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P2901365799" "Untouchable"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thaw 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2439537416" "Thaw"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1756824576" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Cold, Slow)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1511937959" "Warms an ally and frees them from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear, Slow and Immobilize effects and leaves them resistant to such effects for a good while. Thaw also grants the target some resistance to Cold damage. Some of the effects of this power will improve with multiple applications and as you advance in level. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2658451446" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Cold, Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear, and Immobilize effects with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1190732604" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Cold, Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear, and Immobilize effects."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1019438714" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Cold, Slow)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3238831788" "You have been Thawed. You now have temporary resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear and slow effects and your resistance to Cold is improved."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Forge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P851798312" "Forge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P283127640" "Ally +DMG, +To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P2102597321" "Forge a single ally target into a killing machine.  Forge immensely enhances a single ally's Damage and chance to hit. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1211375038" "You greatly increase the Damage and chance to hit of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1510870276" "{PlayerSource} greatly increases your Damage and chance to hit."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3901010973" "+DMG, +To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1551320456" "You have been Forged into a killing machine.  Your Damage and chance to hit have all been increased."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heat Exhaustion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3152332950" "Heat Exhaustion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2999723572" "Ranged Foe -DMG, -END, -Recovery, -Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P810458816" "Overwhelm a single foe with waves of exhausting heat. The initial effect will drain the target of some Endurance, but the heat is so overwhelming that the affected target will be weakened.  Their Damage output, Endurance Recovery and Hit Point Regeneration will all be reduced. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3261174165" "Your {PowerName} reduced the Damage output, Endurance Recovery and HP Regeneration of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P681276275" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Damage output, Endurance Recovery and HP Regeneration."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1827267252" "-DMG, -Recovery, -Regeneration"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1225787959" "Your Damage output, Endurance Recovery and HP Regeneration have been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Melt Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3190899346" "Melt Armor"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P883673132" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Res, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3795509611" "The searing heat from this power is enough to melt the armor and defenses of all targets in the affected area. Melt Armor significantly weakens the Defense and Damage Resistance of the affected targets. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1591168787" "Your {PowerName} reduced the Defense and Damage Resistance of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P503219343" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Defense and Damage Resistance."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1874250117" "-DMG, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P397266516" "Your Defense and Damage Resistances have been reduced."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Time Manipulation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P869452725" "Time Manipulation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P53484883" "By gazing into the flow of time you are able to manipulate time itself.  Time Manipulation allows the wielder to inflict crippling debuffs, buff and heal allies and also be able to empower effects on single targets through careful use of Time Crawl and Temporal Selection."
// SetAccountTooltip :
"P523734060" "You need to either be a VIP player or have purchased the Time Manipulation power set to have access to this feature."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Crawl 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2238940030" "Time Crawl"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1722587764" "Ranged Foe, -Speed, -Recharge, -Regen, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3536371248" "You're able to dramatically slow the time around a single enemy, reducing their movement speed and attack rate.  Time is slowed to such an extreme that their wounds will take longer to heal, reducing their regeneration rate.  Time Crawl applies the Delayed effect on its target.  Debuff and control effects from other Time Manipulation powers are increased on targets affected by Delayed.  Recharge: Long."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P80878853" "-Speed, -Recharge, -Regen, Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3482489949" "Your attack rate, movement speed and regeneration rate have been reduced"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4250415469" "You reduce the attack rate, movement speed, regeneration rate of the target."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2451870868" "{PlayerSource} slows you down to a crawl with their {PowerName}, reducing your movement speed, attack speed and regeneration speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Temporal Mending 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P20492702" "Temporal Mending"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2562578656" "PBAoE, Ally +Heal, Heal Over Time, +Res(Slow, Regen Debuff)"
// Power Help Text :
"P637007078" "You mend the wounds of yourself and nearby allies by placing your bodies in a past or future state where they are far less injured.  Temporal Mending will immediately heal its targets and continue to heal them for an equal amount over the next 6 seconds.  Additionally, affected allies will gain some resistance to slow effects and regeneration debuffs.  Allies affected by the Accelerated effect will receive additional healing from this power.  Temporal Mending will apply a regeneration bonus instead of heal over time for a short while if the user is in a PvP zone.  Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1964158182" "Your {PowerName} heals you for {Damage} health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2599404221" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} health with their {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1831842746" "Your {PowerName} continues to heal you for {Damage} health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4029204276" "{PlayerSource} continually heals you for {Damage} health with their {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Times Juncture 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1147937862" "Time's Juncture"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2191782139" "Toggle: PBAoE Foe (-Damage, -Speed, -To Hit)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4222109235" "You create a time dilation field around you causing enemies who get too close to be slowed to a crawl, their movement speed, damage and chance to hit will be decreased substantially.  Enemies affected by Delayed have these affects increased.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3595822575" "You reduce the damage, movement speed and chance to hit of all nearby foes with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2549879092" "{PlayerSource} reduces your damage, speed and chance to hit with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1722386105" "-Damage, -Speed, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P384004502" "The flow of time has been dramatically slowed around the foe using Time's Juncture reducing your damage, speed and chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Temporal Selection 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P492426561" "Temporal Selection"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3301978780" "Ally +Damage, +Recharge, +Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P3815890288" "You distort time around an ally, selecting a period of time where their abilities are at their highest.  Their damage, attack rate and regeneration rates are dramatically increased for a brief period.  This power places the Accelerated effect on the target.  While this is in effect, the target has any healing and healing over time effects from Temporal Mending or Chrono Shift significantly increased.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P170218134" "You significantly increase {PlayerDest}'s damage, recharge rate and regeneration for a short time."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1338077671" "{PlayerSource} greatly increases your Damage, Recharge Rate and Regeneration."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P760049584" "+Damage, +Recharge, +Regeneration"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2257768674" "Your movements have been sped up as if you're flowing more quickly through time.  You gain a significant bonus to your damage, recharge rate and regeneration."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Distortion Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3035182246" "Distortion Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2771735844" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe(-Recharge, -Speed), Chance for Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P555632213" "You can choose an area to slow the flow of time down to a crawl.  Enemies who enter the field will have their attack rate and speed slowed dramatically.  In addition, affected enemies might become held as they are frozen in time.  Targets affected by Time Crawl will have the chance to be held increased.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3340992146" "Your {PowerName} reduces your targets' Movement and Recharge Speed."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3095982155" "-Speed, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2656174618" "The Distortion Field has reduced your Recharge and Movement Speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Stop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1303004440" "Time Stop"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4217442808" "Ranged Hold, Foe -Regen, -Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P3620751643" "You trap your target within the flow of time causing them to be held helpless.  Even those resistant to the effects of Time Stop's hold will still have their regeneration rate and healing effects reduced for a brief period.  Targets affected by Time Crawl will suffer from a more powerful hold, however its benefits are brief.  Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2288338409" "Hold, -Heal, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3345956946" "You have been held by Time Stop.  Your healing effects and regeneration rate have also been reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3996881439" "You hold {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} and reduce their healing and regeneration rate!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P258318004" "{PlayerSource} holds you with their {PowerName} and reduces your regeneration rate and healing!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1338756627" "Your Time Crawl effect empowers {PowerName}'s hold effect on {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3804716665" "Being Delayed has caused {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} to be more effective."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Farsight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2926793761" "Farsight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3803720508" "PBAoE Team, +To-Hit, +Defense(All), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P2293728109" "You give your allies a brief glimpse of the future and what is to come.  This provides you and your team a moderate increase to your chance to hit and defense for a short period of time.   Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3619822295" "You grant your allies the ability to briefly glimpse into the future thus increasing their Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1389102462" "{PlayerSource} boosts your Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit with {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4278084149" "+To-Hit, +Defense(All), +Perception"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2593400803" "You have brief glimpses of the future allowing you to predict your foes' movements.  Your Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit is increased briefly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Slowed Response 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1310678703" "Slowed Response"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3824425035" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Defense, -Resistance"
// Power Help Text :
"P4177343132" "You manipulate time around a targeted foe causing their reflexes to become slowed and sluggish.  This causes them to have decreased defense and damage resistance.  A target affected by Time Crawl will suffer from a more powerful effect.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1600483695" "Your {PowerName} reduces the defenses and resistances of your target and nearby foes."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2407039961" "{PlayerSource} reduces your defense and resistances with their {PowerName}"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3877240234" "-Defense(All), -Resistance(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2935672040" "Your defense and resistance has been lowered by Slowed Response."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chrono Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3129124653" "Chrono Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1350508662" "PBAoE, Team +Recharge, Heal, +End, Moderate Healing over Time, +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2578936003" "You cause nearby allies to act more quickly by allowing them to slip through the time stream seamlessly.  When Chrono Shift is activated, you and nearby allies will immediately recover a portion of your health and endurance.  Chrono Shift will greatly increase the Recharge Speed of nearby allies for the duration of the power, additionally for a short while the flow of time will constantly undo a portion of your allies' wounds causing them to periodically recover health and recover endurance.  An ally affected by Temporal Selection will recover additional health from Chrono Shift.  Chrono Shift will apply a regeneration bonus instead of heal over time for a short while if the user is in a PvP zone.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P689989828" "Your {PowerName} heal you for {Damage} health."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P147486625" "Your {PowerName} restores {Damage} endurance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P168839769" "{PlayerSource} restores {Damage} endurance with their {PowerName}."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Trick Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2922508614" "Trick Arrow"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4162466956" "Trick Arrows are tipped with an odd variety of payloads, which if used strategically, can dramatically alter a battle site."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Entangling Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3890749173" "Entangling Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2638259388" "Ranged, Target Immobilize, -Fly, Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P4026626189" "Upon impact, the Entangling Arrow releases a strong net that can Immobilize most targets. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking. The Entangling Arrow can bring down flying entities, halts jumping and slows all of your actions. Entangling Arrow has a fairly low Endurance cost and a bonus to its Accuracy. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2964557942" "Immobilize, -Fly, Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3914642772" "You have been caught in a net.  You cannot move or fly and your actions are slowed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P362106426" "You Immobilized {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2175482535" "{PlayerSource} immobilized you with a {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flash Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2538058937" "Flash Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2306152642" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Visibility, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P912604196" "This arrow explodes in a dazzling flash of light and sound. The targets are so blinded that they can hardly see a thing. Most villains will not be able to see past normal melee range, although some may have better perception. If the villains are attacked, they will be alerted to your presence, but will suffer a penalty to chance to hit. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2203852352" "-Visibility, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2481906454" "The flash of light has left you dazzled.  Your chance to hit and range of sight are greatly diminished."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2345218607" "You blind {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}, reducing their perception and chance to hit!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2652110899" "{PlayerSource} blinds you with a {PowerName}, reducing your perception and chance to hit!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Glue Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3237857720" "Glue Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4256049864" "Ranged (TargetedAoE), Foe -Speed, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P1460196302" "This arrow carries a cartridge of intensely sticky glue, which explodes on impact. The glue Slows the movement and attack rates of any foes in the area. Recharge: Very Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4234428342" "You use a {PowerName} to create a sticky patch of ground!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3416938233" "Ice Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3570542779" "Ranged, Foe Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3906379218" "This arrow can freeze a single foe in a block of ice. The target is frozen solid, helpless, and can be attacked. More powerful foes may not be Held, but all affected targets will be Slowed. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2267104667" "Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1196691141" "You are frozen in a Block of Ice.  Once free, your Attack Rate and Running speed will be reduced slightly for a while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poison Gas Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2744262583" "Poison Gas Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1169805848" "Ranged AoE, Foe -DMG, Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P3155999525" "This arrow carries a capsule cloud of poisonous gas, which explodes on impact and weakens all foes in its vicinity. Affected foes damage potential will be severely reduced. Some foes will react badly to the poison and choke for a time, though they will react if attacked.  Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1427562046" "You use a {PowerName} to release a noxious poison gas!"

