// Display Name :
"P2671335934" "Acid Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1037696611" "Ranged AoE Minor DoT(Toxic), Foe -Res(All), -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P328978290" "This arrow explodes in a small shower of acid on impact. This acid eats through armor, causing damage over time. It reduces the target's Defense as well as their Damage Resistance.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P724208132" "Your {PowerName} splashes acid on {PlayerDest}, reducing their resistances to damage."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P472308012" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an Acid Arrow.  The acid is burning you and reducing your damage resistance."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2396833550" "-Res(All), -DEF, Minor DoT(Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1207406105" "Your Resistances and Defense have been weakened by the Acid Arrow."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2022712491" "Your {PowerName} continues to burn {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4225091485" "You continue to burn from the {PowerName} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"

