// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Oil Slick Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P851023681" "Oil Slick Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2794896108" "Ranged (Location AoE), Knockdown, -Speed, -DEF, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3872456209" "On impact, this arrow creates an oil slick that Slows foes in the area and may cause them to slip and fall. The oil slick is very flammable and may burst into flames if fire is used near it.  Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4100491214" "You coat the ground in oil from your {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EMP Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P993615740" "EMP Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1500918562" "AoE, Foe Hold, Special vs. Robots, Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2063198606" "This arrow can unleash a massive pulse of electromagnetic energy on impact. This EMP can affect machines, and is even powerful enough to affect synaptic brain patterns. It will incapacitate all foes in its radius. Additionally, most machines and robots will take moderate high damage. However, this power uses a lot of Endurance and leaves you unable to recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3549109959" "You are held immobile by the EMP Pulse and your Regeneration Rate is reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1371424338" "{PlayerSource} blasts you for {Damage} points of energy damage with their {PowerName}."
